# STORY: covert operations board text (gen_ops_text.py). Generated: edit the script, not this file.
extraStrings:
- type: en-US
  strings: &id001
    STR_OP_PAPER_TRAIL: 'Operation: Twenty Questions'
    STR_OP_PAPER_TRAIL_DESC: Somebody at the border bank moves the cartel's money and smiles at the auditors. Scarlett takes
      a desk across the street and watches who he lunches with, who he calls, and where his deposits go.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Four
      days. If he makes her, the money goes quiet and so does he.
    STR_OP_PAPER_TRAIL_SUCCESS: 'SCARLETT: He keeps a second ledger in his car. I photographed every page while he was at
      lunch. The money goes north before it goes anywhere else.'
    STR_OP_PAPER_TRAIL_EMPTY: 'SCARLETT: Four days of a man eating soup. Either he''s careful or he''s clean. I''d bet careful.'
    STR_OP_PAPER_TRAIL_BLOWN: 'HAWK: The banker made Scarlett on day three. She got out. The cartel will move the money now,
      and they know we''re looking.'
    STR_OP_LONG_NIGHT: 'Operation: My Brother''s Keeper'
    STR_OP_LONG_NIGHT_DESC: The men who ran from the ranch are hiding with family along the river. Scarlett finds them one
      at a time and buys them a drink. Frightened men talk, if somebody gives them a reason.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Three days.
      If we're holding their boss, they'll be more frightened and more talkative.
    STR_OP_LONG_NIGHT_SUCCESS: 'SCARLETT: One of them drove the trucks. He knows the road they used, and he knows the man
      who paid for the guns didn''t speak Spanish.'
    STR_OP_LONG_NIGHT_EMPTY: 'SCARLETT: They''ve all developed the same bad memory. Somebody got to them first.'
    STR_OP_LONG_NIGHT_BLOWN: 'HAWK: The cartel was watching the families. Scarlett walked into a house full of the wrong cousins.
      Get her out.'
    STR_OP_NIGHT_SHIFT: 'Operation: Joe''s Night Out'
    STR_OP_NIGHT_SHIFT_DESC: A machine works in West Texas went bust two years ago and still pays its electric bill. Scarlett
      sits on the road above the gate and counts who comes and goes.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Five days. If she sees them getting
      it ready, we'll know when it starts, and we can be there first.
    STR_OP_NIGHT_SHIFT_SUCCESS: 'SCARLETT: New locks on the gate, a generator on a truck, and a man with a clipboard counting
      crates. They''re opening it, and I can tell you the day.'
    STR_OP_NIGHT_SHIFT_EMPTY: 'SCARLETT: Five nights of tumbleweed. Either it''s dead, or they''re not ready yet.'
    STR_OP_NIGHT_SHIFT_BLOWN: 'HAWK: A patrol found Scarlett''s hide. Whoever owns that factory knows somebody is interested
      in it.'
    STR_OP_FRIENDLY_BARTENDER: 'Operation: The Spy Who Rooked Me'
    STR_OP_FRIENDLY_BARTENDER_DESC: 'Every border town has a bar where the smugglers drink and a bartender who listens. Scarlett
      finds ours and makes him an offer: a monthly envelope for whatever he hears.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Two days and some of our
      money. A good one hears about a run before it happens.'
    STR_OP_FRIENDLY_BARTENDER_SUCCESS: 'SCARLETT: He''s ours. He''ll call when a crew starts drinking like they''ve got a
      job tomorrow.'
    STR_OP_FRIENDLY_BARTENDER_EMPTY: 'SCARLETT: He took the drink and not the money. He''s more scared of them than he likes
      us.'
    STR_OP_FRIENDLY_BARTENDER_BLOWN: 'HAWK: The bartender sold Scarlett to the people he serves. She got out the back. We''re
      not welcome in that town for a while.'
    STR_OP_DEAD_AIR: 'Operation: Cobra Soundwaves'
    STR_OP_DEAD_AIR_DESC: 'Cobra Commander''s message to Washington didn''t come out of thin air. Somewhere there''s a relay
      that carried it: a mast, a van, a rented room with a dish on the roof. Scarlett goes looking with Breaker''s numbers.{NEWLINE}{NEWLINE}Four
      days. Find the relay and we''re halfway to whoever used it.'
    STR_OP_DEAD_AIR_SUCCESS: 'SCARLETT: A rented room over a laundromat, a dish on the roof, and a phone bill paid in cash.
      The man who paid it uses the same name every time.'
    STR_OP_DEAD_AIR_EMPTY: 'SCARLETT: Breaker''s numbers put it in a county. A county is a lot of rooftops.'
    STR_OP_DEAD_AIR_BLOWN: 'HAWK: Cobra was watching its relay. Scarlett walked into their camera. They know her face now.'
- type: en-GB
  strings: *id001
